{"step_index":4468,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T09:55:01Z","thinking":"The current 50% brand similarity threshold is insufficient; examples like \"اولفن\" vs. \"البيران\" at 50% demonstrate this is too low, effectively misclassifying very similar brands. Initial data indicates 60% might also be too low (\"ديباكين\" vs. \"ديبيكان\"). Further investigation needed to determine the appropriate threshold for legitimate matches, considering OCR errors and minor transliteration variations.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Test strength extraction helper\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"import re\\n\\ndef extract_strengths(text: str) -> list[str]:\\n    # Normalize indicators and eastern digits first\\n    t = str(text)\\n    # Remove dates, pack counts like 20قرص, 3شريط, 30كيس\\n    t = re.sub(r'\\\\d+\\\\s*(قرص|اقراص|كبسول|شريط|امبول|كيس|فلتر|علبه|ملل?|سم)', '', t)\\n    # Match patterns like 4/30, 12.5/5, 1000, 500, 250, 457, 642, 0.25, 2.5\\n    matches = re.findall(r'(?:\\\\d+(?:\\\\.\\\\d+)?(?:\\\\/\\\\d+(?:\\\\.\\\\d+)?)*)\\\\s*(?:مجم|جم|مج|gm|mg)', t)\\n    if not matches:\\n        # try without unit if preceding or followed by number\\n        pass\\n    return matches\\n\\nfor s in [\\\"زانوجليد4/30اقراص س ج\\\", \\\"زانوچيلد 4 مج اقراص/باكت 60\\\", \\\"فلوموكس 500 كبسول\\\", \\\"فلوموكس 1000 اقراص\\\"]:\\n    print(s, \\\"->\\\", extract_strengths(s))\\n\"","Description":"\"Test strength extractor\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\kakak\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\\\scratch\\\\test_strength_extractor.py\"","toolAction":"\"Testing strength extraction\"","toolSummary":"\"Test strength extraction logic\""}}]}
